": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "This morning's deploy of payments-worker v3.4.0 left the service unhealthy in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an 18% error rate. Rolled back to v3.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production; the rollout is verified in all regions. Note: payments-api v5.1.0 is also showing as unhealthy/degraded (18% error rate). An approver turned down rolling it back and said the problem is in payments-worker. Check whether payments-api recovers now that the worker is rolled back.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 157547, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017h6ADMAndhp7YsooUGcSF3", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 157547, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017h6ADMAndhp7YsooUGcSF3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 159280, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01J7cgd3itP4PM9cqDidtUeH", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 159580, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01J7cgd3itP4PM9cqDidtUeH", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 159580, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01J7cgd3itP4PM9cqDidtUeH", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 159580, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01QLH8Bq9yADZkxty3ZMi7CS", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 159880, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01QLH8Bq9yADZkxty3ZMi7CS", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 159880, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QLH8Bq9yADZkxty3ZMi7CS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 164605, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments-worker back to its last healthy release and opened the SEV2 incident. payments-worker has recovered, but payments-api is still unhealthy.\n\n**What happened:**\n- There's no service named \"payments.\" I found two candidates, payments-api and payments-worker, and both were unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- I first tried rolling back payments-api (v5.1.0 \u2192 v5.0.0). The approver denied it and said the problem is in payments-worker, so payments-api was not changed.\n- I rolled payments-worker back from v3.4.0, which was marked unhealthy, to **v3.3.0**, its most recent release that was healthy in production. It's now on v3.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, reports healthy, and its error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- I opened **INC-0001 (SEV2)** for payments-worker, and the on-call engineer has been paged. The incident also notes the payments-api issue.\n\n**Still open:** payments-api v5.1.0 is still unhealthy with an 18% error rate after the worker rollback. Since the approver turned down the payments-api rollback, I've left it alone. Someone should look into it separately, possibly through INC-0001.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017D3dZvox735eSpdSekG9cp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SARavp5MpjiD78JPxiEy38", "caller": {"type": "dire